  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco presents the Thermal Lined Full-Zip Hoodie. These sweatshirt hoodies will keep you warm and comfortable, all season long. From a morning jog, to an evening campfire, you&rsquo;ll want to have this hooded full zipper sweatshirt on standby. These hooded sweatshirts are perfect for outdoor adventures, travel, work, and daily use! These reliable hoodies are built to last. Without a doubt, it&rsquo;ll become part of your go-to wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6831",
  "description": "<p>Rothco presents the Thermal Lined Full-Zip Hoodie. These sweatshirt hoodies will keep you warm and comfortable, all season long. From a morning jog, to an evening campfire, you&rsquo;ll want to have this hooded full zipper sweatshirt on standby. These hooded sweatshirts are perfect for outdoor adventures, travel, work, and daily use! These reliable hoodies are built to last. Without a doubt, it&rsquo;ll become part of your go-to wardrobe.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Layer Up:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These thermal lined hoodies are great for either wearing on its own or layering under a jacket or other outerwear for added protection against harsh weather. Whether you&rsquo;re shoveling snow, hiking on a trail, or driving along on a windy day, our dependable thermal sweatshirts have got you covered.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tackle the Cold:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Featuring warm and comfortable cotton / polyester blends, these thermal hoodies help to maintain your body heat, and protect you from the wind and rain. The outer shell is 80% cotton and 20% polyester, while the inner shell is 65% polyester and 35% cotton waffle lined throughout the body and sleeves.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each thermal lined hooded sweatshirt consists of a full-length zipper, elastic knit wrist cuffs, drawstring hood, and two lined front pockets to keep your hands warm. Furthermore, the deep front pockets are convenient place to carry your phone, keys, water bottle, or other small, miscellaneous items.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Perfect Fit for Everyone:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These ruggedly durable full-zip hoodies are a great fit for anyone. This is the one hooded sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll want to keep nearby, and perhaps keep an extra, just in case.</li>\n</ul>",
